<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερᾰμ-εοῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾶ</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέραμος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of clay</i>
			or <i>earth, earthen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάνην εἶχε κεραμεοῦν ἁδρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nico
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.463.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.71
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χρῶμα κεραμεοῦς</span>
			Alex.Mynd. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.398d
			</span></i>:—other spellings found in codd. are <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράμειος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράμεος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ly.</u>
				219e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ctes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				51
			</span></i> M., <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				163.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theophil.
				2
			</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράμεα: ὁ παντοδαπὸς
			κέραμος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράμεον, τό</span>, collect., =
			<i>tile-work</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				36.197
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii/ii B.C.</span>); <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραμαῖοις</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.44.2
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.273
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραμιαῖος</span></b> , ibid.
			(v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				2.18.14
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράμιος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.2.3
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραμοῦς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Heraclid.
			</span></i> Tar. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.827
			</span></i>.</div>
